@host = http://localhost:5100

### Lista os agentes/modelos
GET {{host}}/api/agents

### Canal REST (histórico no servidor) — mesmo fluxo que o Telegram usará
POST {{host}}/channels/rest/conversations/demo-1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Olá! Que horas são em São Paulo?", "agentId": "assistant" }

### Continua a mesma conversa
POST {{host}}/channels/rest/conversations/demo-1/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "E o que eu te perguntei antes?", "agentId": "assistant" }

### Reinicia a conversa
DELETE {{host}}/channels/rest/conversations/demo-1/?agentId=assistant

### Canal Web (AG-UI, resposta em SSE)
POST {{host}}/channels/web/agents/assistant
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "threadId": "thread_1",
  "runId": "run_1",
  "messages": [ { "id": "m1", "role": "user", "content": "Diga oi em uma frase." } ],
  "tools": [],
  "context": [],
  "state": {},
  "forwardedProps": {}
}
